    <marc:datafield tag="520" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
      <marc:subfield code="a">Black smoke stains a summer blue sky. A school is on fire. One mother, Grace, sees the smoke and runs. She knows her teenage daughter Jenny is inside. Grace races along the tree-lined driveway, which Jenny had walked down only a few hours earlier. She goes into the burning building to rescue her child. Afterwards Grace must find the identity of the arsonist and protect her family from the person who&apos;s still intent on destroying them. Afterwards she must confront the face of evil and discover the limitlessness of love.</marc:subfield>
